Description: graphical tool to mount disks, network shares and MTP devices
 Mount-GUI quickly mounts anything, anywhere, with any options. It can
 discover NFS and SMB/CIFS shares on the local network, mount MTP devices,
 and create fstab entries and systemd mount units.
